0.07: Fixing storage overloaded issue
0.08: Added scrolling to Surveys. CORESensor app added.
0.09: Added High Temporal Accelerometry logging (x,y,z per second)
0.10: Fixes to settings.js to account for optimizations in studyTasks.json
0.11: Fixed error in joining study from HeatSuite Node invite broadcasting
      Fixed task notification error, binary data for high frequency data (accelerometer)
      Fixed clear bluetooth device issue with Bangle
      Fixed advertising issue with firmware +2v26 (turned off Manufacturer Data)
      Added capacity for follow up questions in the EMA Surveys
0.12: Added new survey option logic (can simplify numerical response questions)
      Added 5xSTS test (beta)
      Enhanced high resolution acc recording; reduced filesize, customizable
      Added `fontall` support for languages with difference characters (e.g. Simplified Chinese)
      `heatsuite.mass.js` supports both V1 and V2 Mi Scales
      `heatsuite.app.js` made scanning faster for devices (1s scan time)
      `heatsuite.surveylib.js` changed to be more standalone, with more UI options (see docs)
0.13: `heatsuite.surveylib.js` added a right hand scroll bar for questions where the responses exceed the screen space
      `heatsuite.wid.js` fixed charging notification issue
0.14: `heatsuite.wid.js` bug fixes for recorder and bleadverts
      `heatsuite.wid.js` includes ENMO (Euclidean Norm Minus One) for movement standardization
      `heatsuite.app.js` optimizations
      `heatsuite.surveylib.js` fixed crash when fontall not installed
0.15: `heatsuite.default.json` added for compatibility
      `custom.html` Added "Cloud Connect" tab profile loading
      Added manifest source tracking for settings, tasks, and surveys
      Normalized StudyTasks loading to an array
      Renamed high accelerometry max-records setting to `BinMaxRecords`
